{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちぴょんひなぴょん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新曲名、解禁！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「バレッタ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願い申し上げます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"精一杯良いものにしていきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/10/30/0930783/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"題名にちなみ\nバレッタ5つくらいつけてみた(｡•ө•｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へたっぴ落書きもしてみた⍢⃝⍤⃝。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"+++"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\\乃木どこ？みてくれたかなー♡?/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私....\n実は魔法使いではなく妖精なのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ティンカー・ヒナです。(語呂悪し。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/10/30/0930783/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"大人にならないで...♡\nネバーランドで一緒に住みませんか？\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひな的には、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あなたは、いつまで子供なの？」\n(ななみん作)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が個人的に好きだけど、\n設定的に\"大人にならないで\"にしました‼︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ、15歳だけどっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゅん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/10/30/0930783/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"+++"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前、\n乃木坂派のお渡し会をやりました‼︎。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"H列(川後・生駒・深川)\nに当たって来てくださった方\nありがとうございました！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイン当たった方いますかっっ？♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大事にしてくださいねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真集を渡す役をやったのですが\nその時にほとんど